msgid ""
"**说明：**\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Description:**\n"
""

msgid ""
"* 推理后端为 ``vLLM`` 镜像中，vLLM、vLLM-ascend、MindSpeed、Megatron-LM、verl 为源码安装，源码位于镜像根目录 ``/`` 下。\n"
"* 推理后端为 ``SGLang`` 镜像中，SGLang、MindSpeed、verl 为源码安装，源码位于镜像根目录 ``/`` 下。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"* For images where the inference backend is ``vLLM``, vLLM, vLLM-ascend, MindSpeed, Megatron-LM, and verl are installed from source. The source code is located in the root directory ``/`` of the image.\n"
"* For images where the inference backend is ``SGLang``, SGLang, MindSpeed, and verl are installed from source. The source code is located in the root directory ``/`` of the image.\n"
""

msgid ""
"镜像构建命令示例\n"
"--------------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Image build command examples\n"
"-----------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"* 以 vLLM 的镜像为例，``Dockerfile.ascend_8.5.0_a2`` 为 Dockerfile 文件名，``verl-ascend:8.5.0-a2`` 中，verl-ascend 为自定义的镜像名称，8.5.0-a2 为自定义的镜像标签\n"
""
msgstr ""
"* Using the vLLM image as an example, ``Dockerfile.ascend_8.5.0_a2`` is the Dockerfile name. In ``verl-ascend:8.5.0-a2``, verl-ascend is the custom image name, and 8.5.0-a2 is the custom image tag.\n"
""

msgid ""
"容器启动命令模板\n"
"----------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Container Startup Command Template\n"
"----------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"* 如需挂载其他本地路径到容器，请自行添加 ``-v <宿主机路径>:<容器内路径>``\n"
"* 建议将 ``{your_docker_name}`` 替换为具有实际意义的容器名称\n"
"* ``--privileged`` 参数授予容器扩展权限，请根据实际安全需求评估是否必要\n"
"* ``{image_name}:{tag}`` 请换成容器构建时对应的镜像名称与标签\n"
""
msgstr ""
"* If you need to mount other local paths to the container, add ``-v <host machine path>:<container path>``.\n"
"* We recommend replacing ``{your_docker_name}`` with a meaningful container name.\n"
"* The ``--privileged`` parameter grants extended permissions to the container. Evaluate whether this is necessary based on your security requirements.\n"
"* Replace ``{image_name}:{tag}`` with the image name and tag used during the container build.\n"
""

